====Usage notes====
The "severe acute respiratory syndrome" translates into Finnish as {{m|fi|[[äkillinen]] [[vakava]] [[hengitystie]][[oireyhtymä]]}}, but the term is seldom used. Usually the English initialism SARS is used as the Finnish name of this illness. An individual occurrence of SARS may be referred to as {{m|en|tapaus|SARS-tapaus}}.

